    <title>EP.14【音乐篇】欧美歌曲大安利！回到神仙打架的年代</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6617cb4a48c40e2fb0b0dddf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6617cb4a48c40e2fb0b0dddf</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2024 11:36:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>主播：橙子、Vivian</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>嘉宾：沙琪玛</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>后期：橙子</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>策划宣传：Vivian、橙子</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>欢迎收听就现在FM，这期我们终于聊到了欧美音乐！因为时间关系，我们每个人只分享了两首2010年到2015年里，想要安利的歌曲，选择歌曲的时候就感觉两首不够啊，但是依旧聊得很开心，几乎每首都可以进行大合唱~🎵</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>也希望大家可以听得开心，不知道其中有没有你们曾经循环过的歌曲呢？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>欢迎在评论区留下你们最爱的欧美歌曲，让我们的歌单也多点好听的歌！也欢迎加入听友群，和我们一起交流讨论吧~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>也欢迎给我们投稿给建议点击：</span><a href="https://y1qkkriovv3.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnGwWaanrODRZNZtSa5QuUDc" data-url="https://y1qkkriovv3.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnGwWaanrODRZNZtSa5QuUDc"><span>就现在FM留言箱✉：</span></a></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrgiVHLyXMRlv-h2lyJLU1Ga-mqP.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>【安利2010~2015年的欧美歌曲】</span></em><span>🎙</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Vivian：Welcome To New York--Taylor Swift、Love Yourself--Justin Bieber</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>橙子：Diamonds--Rihanna、Payphone--Maroon 5&amp;Wiz Khalifa</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>沙琪玛：Wrecking Ball--Miley Cyrus、Call Me Maybe--Carly Rae Jepsen</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>【本期时间线】🎞</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>总时长：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a>分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span>花絮：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> &nbsp;开场介绍，每个人安利两首2010年~2015年的欧美歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> &nbsp;沙琪玛推荐的第一首歌曲：Wrecking Ball--Miley Cyrus</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> &nbsp;Vivian推荐的第一首歌曲：Welcome To New York--Taylor Swift</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> &nbsp;橙子推荐的第一首歌曲：Diamonds--Rihanna；疯狂安利Diamonds维密的现场，Rihanna气场全开！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> &nbsp;Vivian推荐的第二首歌曲：Love Yourself--Justin Bieber；同专辑的sorry也非常推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> &nbsp;橙子推荐的第二首歌曲：Payphone--Maroon 5&amp;Wiz Khalifa</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> &nbsp;沙琪玛推荐的第二首歌曲：Call Me Maybe--Carly Rae Jepsen</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>Rihanna维密现场图，美到爆炸！你快回来发歌呀！</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmyKOGpftZVPziwPdV5tZdeNkx5e.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvIxoWbQpioqxv1XMfqjq2SgRZDl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【THE END】😍</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后我们各自选了一首最喜欢的歌曲！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vivian：Welcome To New York--Taylor Swift</span></p><span></span><p><span>橙子：Payphone--Maroon 5&amp;Wiz Khalifa</span></p><span></span><p><span>沙琪玛：Call Me Maybe--Carly Rae Jepsen</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：Welcome To New York--Taylor Swift</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Call Me Maybe--Carly Rae Jepsen</span></p><span></span><p><span>那本期内容也到此结束，那我们下期见Byebye~💜</span></p>]]></description>
