timestamp="396">06:36</a> &nbsp;橙子推荐第一部动画片：神厨小福贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> &nbsp;沙琪玛推荐第一部动画片：中华小当家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> &nbsp;Vivian推荐第二部动画片：马丁的早晨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> &nbsp;沙琪玛推荐第二部动画片：网球王子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> &nbsp;橙子推荐第二部动画片：百变小樱魔术卡（魔卡少女樱）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> &nbsp;Vivian推荐第三部动画片：名侦探柯南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> &nbsp;Vivian推荐第四部动画片（因为弄混淆角色，被打回重说哈哈哈哈哈）：东京喰种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> &nbsp;橙子推荐第三部动画片：中华小子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> &nbsp;沙琪玛推荐第三部动画片：奥林匹斯星传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> &nbsp;片尾曲争霸赛开始~猜猜是哪一部动画片主题曲荣获第一呢？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>【The End】🥞</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>本期动画童年专场也聊的很开心！</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>之后也会不定期返场我们会去讲日漫😼</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期Top1动画:来自Vivian安利的《马丁的早晨》</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>也欢迎在荔枝、网易云、apple podcast、豆瓣都能搜索到🔍</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>那我们下期再见Bye bye~❤</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
